{"schema_version":1,"stream":"steps","idempotency_key":"step:run_e9f7394d17bc:reviewer:commit:1:0","created_at":"2026-10-30 02:56:25","provenance":"recorded","origin":{"recorder":{"installation_id":"eca1b52d-1c4f-4337-9c73-d8c035d3b08c"},"performer":{"kind":"agent","role":"reviewer","provider":"claude-code"}},"payload":{"step_name":"reviewer:commit","phase":"1","iteration":0,"result_json":{"readiness":"ready_with_corrections","items":[{"id":"P2.1","title":"checkboxIdentity now normalizes every checkbox after a lone CR, changing persisted structuralSignature","action":"auto_fix","reason":"The phase gate says no caller outside the new module changes behavior, and the plan says the move keeps the regex and replacement unchanged. checkboxIdentity switched from a single non-multiline replace to the gm normalizer.","priority":"P2","scopeClass":"implementation_defect","effortDelta":1,"architectureDelta":0,"failure":"For \"# T\\n- [x] a\\r- [x] b\\n\", structuralSignature is sha256:5780f9b4... at 4adb443b and sha256:ab8c7fd2... at 9e40af03. A text guard snapshotted by the prior binary fails PLAN_AMENDMENT_STRUCTURE, and toggling the second checkbox no longer changes the signature.","lowestCostCorrection":"Use the original single-match, non-multiline regex in checkboxIdentity and add one unit test.","introducedBy":{"commitRange":"4adb443b0d2e88a8e59106eb743b2b9454077e4f..9e40af03f6a52ad6cf4d5672cd726a8f35c1426a","diffHunk":"diff --git a/5x-cli/src/review-governance/plan-amendment.ts b/5x-cli/src/review-governance/plan-amendment.ts\n@@ -169,18 +172,8 @@ export function extractBudgetTableBytes(\n \treturn { ok: true, tableBytes: markdown.slice(start, end) };\n }\n \n-const CHECKBOX_MARKER_SOURCE = String.raw`^(\\s*(?:[-*+]|\\d+\\.)\\s+)\\[[ xX]\\]`;\n-\n-/**\n- * Collapse `[ ]`, `[x]`, and `[X]` to `[ ]` without changing byte length.\n- * Other bytes, including text injected in place of a marker, stay intact.\n- */\n-export function normalizeCheckboxMarkers(markdown: string): string {\n-\treturn markdown.replace(new RegExp(CHECKBOX_MARKER_SOURCE, \"gm\"), \"$1[ ]\");\n-}\n-\n function checkboxIdentity(line: string): string {\n-\treturn line.replace(new RegExp(CHECKBOX_MARKER_SOURCE), \"$1[ ]\");\n+\treturn normalizeCheckboxMarkers(line);\n }\n \n /** Phase headings, checklist identities, and protected section bytes. */\n","explanation":"This hunk replaced the single-match checkboxIdentity regex with normalizeCheckboxMarkers, which uses the gm flags, so ^ also matches after a lone CR inside a newline-split line."},"planWorkItemIds":["W1"],"boundaryChanges":[],"mechanicalExplanation":"Restore line.replace(new RegExp(CHECKBOX_MARKER_SOURCE), \"$1[ ]\") in checkboxIdentity by exporting the source constant (or a single-line helper) from plan-markdown.ts, and add a lone-CR regression test."}],"summary":"Phase 1 delivers the specified pure projection: grammar, file, schema 0 and schema 1 modes, fence opacity, note validation, the one-blank splice, the space-filled mask with a raw-string byte conversion, and the authority constant. W1 tests cover the Tests row. One P2 mechanical fix remains: checkboxIdentity in plan-amendment.ts now uses the multiline normalizer, which changes the persisted structuralSignature for lines that contain a lone CR."},"head_commit":"24d20fe47a4b10c41f45a6c9b2588699fee1b15f","patch_id":null,"diff_summary":{"files_changed":0,"insertions":0,"deletions":0},"duration_ms":819562,"tokens_in":54,"tokens_out":24400,"cost_usd":1.8111608,"model":"claude-opus-5-5"}}
